[14.050536, "o", "   - Set the setgid bit so new files inherit the group\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[14.050558, "o", "   - Base permissions: 2770 (rwxrws---)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[14.050585, "o", "> "]
[14.050722, "o", "2. Configure ACLs on /srv/shared:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Group \"research\": full rwx permissions (both current and default)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[14.050803, "o", "   - Users \"alice\" and \"bob\": full rwx permissions (both current and default)  \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[14.050832, "o", "   - Others: no permissions (both current and default)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[14.050867, "o", "   - Set proper mask to allow full permissions\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[14.050889, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[14.050968, "o", "3. The ACL configuration must ensure that:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[14.051014, "o", "   - Any file created by alice or bob in /srv/shared is accessible by both users\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[14.051068, "o", "   - The permissions are inherited by subdirectories and files\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[14.051233, "o", "   - Users outside the research group cannot access the directory or its contents\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[14.051274, "o", "Note: Do NOT create any files in the directory. The tests will verify permission inheritance\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
